[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5128991977","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121923#issuecomment-5128991977","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121923","id":5128991977,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABMbY06Q","user":{"login":"aurpine","id":12262539,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyMjYyNTM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/12262539?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/aurpine","html_url":"https://github.com/aurpine","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aurpine/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aurpine/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aurpine/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aurpine/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aurpine/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aurpine/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aurpine/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aurpine/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aurpine/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-30T09:24:27Z","updated_at":"2026-07-30T20:27:47Z","body":"I am still convinced it's MSVC shenanigans making it slow, but this one actually makes a difference on GCC too ~(about 2-5%)~. ","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5128991977/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5129070178","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121923#issuecomment-5129070178","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121923","id":5129070178,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABMbdmYg","user":{"login":"Ivorforce","id":2308167,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMDgxNjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2308167?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce","html_url":"https://github.com/Ivorforce","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-30T09:30:08Z","updated_at":"2026-07-30T09:30:08Z","body":"Yea since the definition is in the `.cpp`, the compiler does not know that the assignment is unnecessary on either compile unit (caller and callee). \r\nSome systems are built with LTO which you might expect to catch this, but even in that scenario i wouldn't expect it to be able to always reason away the data write. The compiler would need to be absolutely sure that the memory is not used by anything else after (as part of the same allocation), which I'm not sure is possible in many situations.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5129070178/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5129539731","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121923#issuecomment-5129539731","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121923","id":5129539731,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABMb6Qkw","user":{"login":"bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg","html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-30T10:17:20Z","updated_at":"2026-07-30T10:17:20Z","body":"How exactly this was tested (which build config)?\r\n\r\nWhile I see some difference, it seems to be close to margin or error. Profiling with Xcode 26.6 on macOS, debug build. The same code, but with 5M loop:\r\n\r\nBefore:\r\n<img width=\"1399\" height=\"539\" alt=\"Screenshot 2026-07-30 at 13 09 34\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/d20c69db-c7df-4cc1-af16-2fb96f8859b6\" />\r\n\r\nAfter:\r\n<img width=\"1399\" height=\"508\" alt=\"Screenshot 2026-07-30 at 13 07 37\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/7754df32-1386-408c-90b1-b77128fb646b\" />\r\n","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5129539731/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5134233497","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121923#issuecomment-5134233497","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121923","id":5134233497,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABMgYvmQ","user":{"login":"aurpine","id":12262539,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyMjYyNTM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/12262539?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/aurpine","html_url":"https://github.com/aurpine","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aurpine/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aurpine/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aurpine/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aurpine/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aurpine/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aurpine/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aurpine/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aurpine/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aurpine/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-30T17:37:41Z","updated_at":"2026-07-30T17:38:28Z","body":"The profiling results are from VS2022 on release templates (Windows 11, MSVC). We don't have the _profile_ built-in so I put together a build command from the editor version. \r\n\r\n`\r\necho Starting SCons & cmd /V /C set \"plat=$(PlatformTarget)\" ^& (if \"$(PlatformTarget)\"==\"x64\" (set \"plat=x86_amd64\")) ^& call \"C:\\Program Files\\Microsoft Visual Studio\\2022\\Community\\VC\\Auxiliary\\Build\\vcvars64.bat\" !plat! ^& scons --directory=\"$(ProjectDir.TrimEnd('\\'))\" progress=no platform=windows target=template_release arch=x86_64 dev_build=yes debug_symbols=yes d3d12=no disable_path_overrides=no\r\n`\r\n\r\nThanks for testing on macOS. My testing results with GCC are similar. I notice lower numbers, but the test setup has a lot of variance. I run with N=10M and open the release templates file multiple times because sometimes I notice it is slower upon loading.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5134233497/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5136027568","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121923#issuecomment-5136027568","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121923","id":5136027568,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABMiGPsA","user":{"login":"aurpine","id":12262539,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyMjYyNTM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/12262539?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/aurpine","html_url":"https://github.com/aurpine","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aurpine/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aurpine/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aurpine/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aurpine/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aurpine/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aurpine/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aurpine/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aurpine/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aurpine/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-30T20:38:45Z","updated_at":"2026-07-30T20:38:45Z","body":"Did a more comprehensive micro-benchmark via godotengine/godot-docs#12200. \r\n\r\n<details>\r\n<summary><code>test_user_bench.cpp</code></summary>\r\n\r\n```cpp\r\n#include \"tests/test_macros.h\"\r\n\r\nTEST_FORCE_LINK(test_user_bench)\r\n\r\n#include <chrono>\r\n#include <iostream>\r\n#include \"core/variant/variant.h\"\r\n#include \"core/object/object.h\"\r\n#include <algorithm> // for shuffle\r\n#include <vector>\r\n#include <random>\r\n\r\nclass CustomObject : public Object {\r\n\tGDCLASS(CustomObject, Object);\r\n};\r\n\r\n\r\nvoid f() {\r\n    const int N = 100'000'000;\r\n\r\n    std::vector<Object *> objs;\r\n\r\n    for (int i = 0; i < 1024; i++) {\r\n        objs.push_back(memnew(CustomObject));\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    auto t = std::chrono::high_resolution_clock::now();\r\n\r\n    for (int i = 0; i < N; i++) {\r\n        Variant a(objs[i & 1023]);\r\n        if (!a) { // So the construction doesn't get optimized out\r\n            break;\r\n        }\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    auto t2 = std::chrono::high_resolution_clock::now();\r\n    auto duration = std::chrono::duration_cast<std::chrono::milliseconds>(t2 - t).count();\r\n\r\n    std::cout << (duration / 1000.) << std::endl;\r\n\r\n    for (int i = 0; i < 1024; i++) {\r\n        memdelete(objs[i]);\r\n    }\r\n}\r\n\r\nstatic void user_bench() {\r\n    for (int i = 0; i < 5; i++) {\r\n\t    f();\r\n    }\r\n}\r\n\r\nREGISTER_TEST_COMMAND(\"user-bench\", &user_bench)\r\n```\r\n</details>\r\n\r\nEach run of the test tries 5 times - 100M Variant Object constructions and destructions. I ran this 6 times on release templates alternating master and pr. The 6x5 results are summarized below. Units are in seconds.\r\n\r\n### MinGW\r\n\r\n| | PR | Master |\r\n| --- | --- | --- |\r\n| Average | 0.654 | 0.661 |\r\n| P25 | 0.652 | 0.658 |\r\n| Geomean | 0.654 | 0.661 |\r\n| Std. Dev. | 0.0028 | 0.0047 |\r\n\r\n### MSVC\r\n\r\n| | PR | Master |\r\n| --- | --- | --- |\r\n| Average | 0.728 | 0.741 |\r\n| P25 | 0.725 | 0.738 |\r\n| Geomean | 0.728 | 0.741 |\r\n| Std. Dev. | 0.0041 | 0.0052 |\r\n\r\nThis amounts to 1-2% 😅. So yeah this is weird. Profiling results show a consistent ~5%+ drop in time spent in the destructor. Could it be something to do with `dev_build` or `debug_symbols`? ","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5136027568/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5136107869","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121923#issuecomment-5136107869","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121923","id":5136107869,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABMiLJXQ","user":{"login":"Ivorforce","id":2308167,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMDgxNjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2308167?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce","html_url":"https://github.com/Ivorforce","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-30T20:47:27Z","updated_at":"2026-07-30T20:49:00Z","body":"> Could it be something to do with `dev_build` or `debug_symbols`?\r\n\r\nYes, `dev_build=yes` leads to `optimize=none` which doesn't represent a real build. Editor builds run with `-O2` and release builds with `-O3` (which you can get by not providing `dev_build=yes` / `optimize=speed_trace`, and `target=release` or `optimize=speed` for the `-O3`).","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5136107869/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5136575695","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121923#issuecomment-5136575695","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121923","id":5136575695,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABMinszw","user":{"login":"aurpine","id":12262539,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyMjYyNTM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/12262539?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/aurpine","html_url":"https://github.com/aurpine","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aurpine/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aurpine/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aurpine/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aurpine/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aurpine/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aurpine/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aurpine/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aurpine/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aurpine/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-30T21:43:56Z","updated_at":"2026-07-30T21:43:56Z","body":"Ah sorry about that. Yeah non-dev_build numbers are much much smaller. 🤦\r\n\r\n<img width=\"506\" height=\"261\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/d32580e9-584d-447d-a837-83fa9d34b4f5\" />","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5136575695/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hoora